2 CONT
2 CONT Estelle Slutsky Goodman was born on July 11, 1929 in Coney Island, Brooklyn, New York.
2 CONT
2 CONT Estelle had two siblings, a brother, Jack, and sister, Hilda. She married Leon Goodman on October 2, 1948, and they raised three children together: Michael, Andrew, and Vicki. Estelle was widowed on July 29, 2006. She died near he
2 CONC r daughter in Sarasota, Florida on January 31, 2025.
